name pictex
category Package
revision 59551
shortdesc Picture drawing macros for TeX and LaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc PicTeX is an early and very comprehensive drawing package that
longdesc mostly draws by placing myriads of small dots to make up
longdesc pictures. It has a tendency to run out of space; packages
longdesc m-pictex and pictexwd deal with the problems in different ways.
runfiles size=81
